  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>An Ion Pistol fires a stream of energy that wreaks havoc on electrical systems, making it effective against <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droids\" title=\"Droids\">Droids</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicles\" title=\"Vehicles\">Vehicles</a>, electronic devices, and cybernetically enhanced creatures. It deals normal damage against such targets, and has a chance of pushing its target down the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>. Creatures without cybernetics take half damage from a successful attack, and suffer no other ill effects. </p><p>An Ion Pistol requires a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> to operate. After 30 shots, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> must be replaced. </p>",
